1
00:00:58,970 --> 00:01:01,765
Lee Wing-lam, I'm sorry

2
00:01:23,807 --> 00:01:25,257
Do you recognize me?

3
00:01:28,034 --> 00:01:29,361
Of course I do

4
00:01:33,248 --> 00:01:35,522
This upcoming November 15th

5
00:01:36,008 --> 00:01:37,352
I'm getting married

6
00:01:39,459 --> 00:01:41,357
Will you be my maid of honour?

7
00:01:44,770 --> 00:01:46,043
Ms. Lee is inside

8
00:01:46,084 --> 00:01:47,017
Thank you

9
00:02:09,405 --> 00:02:11,477
I've always hated wearing dresses

10
00:02:11,876 --> 00:02:14,781
So I never liked being anyone's bridesmaid

11
00:02:15,456 --> 00:02:18,564
Except this one time, I couldn't say no

12
00:02:19,479 --> 00:02:21,063
Because the bride

13
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:23,188
was the first person in my life

14
00:02:24,022 --> 00:02:25,751
I ever fell in love with

15
00:03:16,295 --> 00:03:23,248
"The First Girl I Loved"

16
00:03:24,959 --> 00:03:28,105
(Autumn, 2001)

17
00:03:29,209 --> 00:03:31,461
That year, Eason Chan's "King of Karaoke"

18
00:03:31,501 --> 00:03:33,709
won Supreme Song at the Ultimate Song Chart Awards

19
00:03:33,792 --> 00:03:36,792
Leslie Cheung had just held his Passion Tour at the Coliseum

20
00:03:36,852 --> 00:03:38,044
The cover of "YES!" magazine

21
00:03:38,084 --> 00:03:40,741
featured Nicholas Tse holding a guitar for "Viva"

22
00:03:40,917 --> 00:03:42,752
Our teachers told us we were so fortunate

23
00:03:42,804 --> 00:03:46,596
Because we lived in an era
full of free choices

24
00:03:46,917 --> 00:03:48,252
My name is Lee Wing-lam

25
00:03:48,292 --> 00:03:50,502
Thanks to Hong Kong's "through-train" education system

26
00:03:50,542 --> 00:03:52,748
I spent twelve years at an all-girls school

27
00:03:53,851 --> 00:03:56,622
Twelve years as class monitor, three years as a prefect

28
00:03:57,420 --> 00:03:59,586
I don't just become friends with anyone

29
00:03:59,626 --> 00:04:01,586
I only ever consider people as "classmates"

30
00:04:01,626 --> 00:04:03,461
To me, breaking school rules is breaking school rules

31
00:04:03,501 --> 00:04:05,339
Black is black, white is white

32
00:04:05,584 --> 00:04:07,226
Do you all understand what I'm saying?

33
00:04:07,542 --> 00:04:08,612
Dismissed

34
00:04:10,251 --> 00:04:12,917
She was my only "best friend" in all those years

35
00:04:13,251 --> 00:04:14,627
Her name was Lee Sum-yuet

36
00:04:14,667 --> 00:04:16,703
Being with her felt so comfortable

37
00:04:17,334 --> 00:04:20,979
Sometimes it could be exciting, but other times pretty silly

38
00:04:21,899 --> 00:04:24,352
Every night, it felt like we had endless things to talk about

39
00:04:24,542 --> 00:04:27,764
Our record was talking for six hours, until dawn

40
00:04:28,459 --> 00:04:30,872
Once, we talked about our dreams

41
00:04:31,091 --> 00:04:33,961
She said she really wanted to direct a film of her own one day

42
00:04:35,626 --> 00:04:37,334
And my dream?

43
00:05:06,917 --> 00:05:07,650
Every girl

44
00:05:07,690 --> 00:05:10,513
has a love letter she dared write but never dared send

45
00:05:10,875 --> 00:05:12,690
I was no exception, of course

46
00:05:13,417 --> 00:05:14,293
This crush

47
00:05:14,333 --> 00:05:16,685
was something I only ever told my most trusted best friend

48
00:05:20,398 --> 00:05:23,252
Little did I know, the one who helped send that love letter

49
00:05:23,292 --> 00:05:25,484
turned out to be her!

50
00:05:40,735 --> 00:05:42,130
Lee Wing-lam?

51
00:05:43,542 --> 00:05:44,792
Hey, don't leave just yet

52
00:05:45,251 --> 00:05:46,745
I have something to tell you

53
00:05:53,443 --> 00:05:55,029
Here's your letter back

54
00:05:59,501 --> 00:06:01,023
That letter isn't mine

55
00:06:14,376 --> 00:06:16,417
This one isn't mine either

56
00:06:29,892 --> 00:06:31,498
This one's mine

57
00:06:35,702 --> 00:06:39,427
Actually, having feelings for someone is a good thing

58
00:06:40,535 --> 00:06:42,305
Just not so early

59
00:06:44,667 --> 00:06:45,844
Also

60
00:06:46,167 --> 00:06:47,638
I'm getting married soon

61
00:06:48,251 --> 00:06:49,627
I'll be leaving Hong Kong

62
00:06:49,667 --> 00:06:52,106
to emigrate with my new wife

63
00:06:54,251 --> 00:06:55,402
Really?

64
00:06:58,584 --> 00:06:59,734
Congratulations

65
00:07:16,876 --> 00:07:18,102
Sorry

66
00:07:37,251 --> 00:07:38,627
Why are you messing with me?

67
00:07:38,667 --> 00:07:39,959
Huh?

68
00:07:40,717 --> 00:07:41,961
I'm asking you

69
00:07:42,002 --> 00:07:43,751
Why are you messing with me?

70
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:46,034
What are you talking about?

71
00:07:47,167 --> 00:07:48,876
Are you done messing around?

72
00:07:49,751 --> 00:07:51,578
Why are you yelling at me?

73
00:07:54,473 --> 00:07:56,620
Why did you do that?

74
00:08:00,751 --> 00:08:04,049
I'd rather he never knew

75
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:08,119
Why did you do that?

76
00:08:29,584 --> 00:08:31,042
Because...

77
00:08:32,653 --> 00:08:36,299
The one I like is you, idiot

78
00:08:46,459 --> 00:08:48,584
Hello, I'm Wasabi

79
00:08:50,208 --> 00:08:52,159
What should we talk about tonight?

80
00:08:52,501 --> 00:08:55,905
Let's bring in an old friend for a chat

81
00:08:56,603 --> 00:08:57,946
Love

82
00:08:58,317 --> 00:08:59,855
Tonight, though, it's about

83
00:09:00,014 --> 00:09:01,220
secret crushes

84
00:09:01,817 --> 00:09:03,579
Not you having a crush on someone

85
00:09:03,672 --> 00:09:06,084
but someone having a crush on you

86
00:09:07,167 --> 00:09:10,911
Don't think you'd be oblivious if someone had a crush on you

87
00:09:11,385 --> 00:09:14,991
Because if they like you, deep down they want you to know

88
00:09:16,005 --> 00:09:20,334
So they'll drop little hints to test the waters

89
00:09:21,156 --> 00:09:22,696
Like

90
00:09:22,836 --> 00:09:24,321
making up excuses

91
00:09:24,362 --> 00:09:27,049
to casually get close to you

92
00:09:27,751 --> 00:09:30,979
pretending to touch you by accident

93
00:09:33,501 --> 00:09:36,002
Or if they're bold enough

94
00:09:36,042 --> 00:09:37,961
they might just come right out and say it

95
00:09:38,001 --> 00:09:39,586
to see how you react

96
00:09:39,626 --> 00:09:42,169
Why don't you try liking something

97
00:09:42,209 --> 00:09:44,331
people won't let you like?

98
00:09:47,801 --> 00:09:49,009
Like what?

99
00:09:53,256 --> 00:09:54,223
Me

100
00:09:55,137 --> 00:09:57,711
And if you look stunned

101
00:09:57,751 --> 00:10:01,110
that's when they'll immediately play it off

102
00:10:01,549 --> 00:10:02,964
"No, just kidding!"

103
00:10:03,167 --> 00:10:04,251
Pretty good, right?

104
00:10:04,292 --> 00:10:05,791
Let me write that down

105
00:10:07,567 --> 00:10:11,334
You'll start noticing they're curious about everything you do

106
00:10:11,626 --> 00:10:15,613
They might even look at you and smile like an idiot

107
00:10:16,621 --> 00:10:17,210
Well?

108
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:19,758
Did someone actually pop into your head?

109
00:10:20,417 --> 00:10:21,294
If so

110
00:10:21,335 --> 00:10:23,228
this song is dedicated to you

111
00:10:23,521 --> 00:10:27,612
and to everyone who longs for love but is too afraid to love

112
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:57,347
Class monitor, hand these out for me

113
00:11:01,028 --> 00:11:02,777
You have 40 minutes to finish

114
00:11:03,084 --> 00:11:04,543
Get ready, everyone

115
00:11:04,709 --> 00:11:06,362
You may now begin

116
00:11:17,001 --> 00:11:18,625
Mr. Cheung

117
00:11:18,665 --> 00:11:20,032
I'm not feeling well

118
00:11:20,167 --> 00:11:21,745
Can I go to the clinic?

119
00:11:22,376 --> 00:11:24,006
We're in the middle of a test

120
00:11:24,126 --> 00:11:26,128
Are you not feeling well, or do you just not know the answers?

121
00:11:27,001 --> 00:11:28,814
I have period cramps, sir

122
00:11:29,084 --> 00:11:31,037
Can it really hurt that badly all of a sudden?

123
00:11:31,167 --> 00:11:33,397
- Yes
- Yes

124
00:11:35,502 --> 00:11:37,417
- Class monitor, make it quick
- Yes, sir

125
00:11:40,709 --> 00:11:41,856
Here

126
00:11:44,293 --> 00:11:45,513
Where's the water?

127
00:11:51,896 --> 00:11:53,022
Water...

128
00:11:59,209 --> 00:12:00,584
It's so cold

129
00:12:05,834 --> 00:12:06,813
Woah

130
00:12:07,116 --> 00:12:08,789
Your hands are so cold

131
00:12:15,042 --> 00:12:17,151
Your hands are so warm

132
00:12:29,126 --> 00:12:30,454
Lee Wing-lam

133
00:12:31,034 --> 00:12:32,980
Actually, yesterday...

134
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,334
I was just joking

135
00:12:36,670 --> 00:12:39,989
Why don't we just pretend nothing happened?

136
00:12:45,167 --> 00:12:48,307
Actually, I thought she was joking at first too

137
00:12:48,876 --> 00:12:50,745
But for some reason

138
00:12:50,870 --> 00:12:52,591
after hearing her say that

139
00:12:53,042 --> 00:12:54,861
it actually made me feel

140
00:12:54,994 --> 00:12:58,126
what she said might be true

141
00:13:00,869 --> 00:13:04,251
No, I think I need to clear things up with her as soon as possible

142
00:13:13,834 --> 00:13:15,904
Class, empty your desks

143
00:13:15,945 --> 00:13:18,664
and please take out all of your belongings

144
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:21,907
Hurry up

145
00:13:24,666 --> 00:13:25,913
Hurry up!

146
00:13:27,584 --> 00:13:28,584
What is this?

147
00:13:33,751 --> 00:13:35,787
The school rules are very clear

148
00:13:35,876 --> 00:13:38,584
No students are allowed to bring mobile phones

149
00:13:38,976 --> 00:13:40,602
Whose phone is this?

150
00:13:49,376 --> 00:13:50,751
It's...

151
00:13:52,042 --> 00:13:53,446
It's mine

152
00:13:57,190 --> 00:13:58,597
So honest, huh?

153
00:13:58,690 --> 00:13:59,627
Starting today

154
00:13:59,667 --> 00:14:01,754
you'll clean the chapel after school for a week

155
00:14:03,042 --> 00:14:04,240
My pleasure

156
00:14:05,167 --> 00:14:07,752
Daddy understands, Daddy knows

157
00:14:07,792 --> 00:14:09,601
It's your mom's fault, okay?

158
00:14:09,709 --> 00:14:10,935
It's late, get some sleep

159
00:14:10,975 --> 00:14:13,001
Don't overthink it, everything's fine, okay?

160
00:14:17,429 --> 00:14:19,075
How is she? Is our daughter still mad?

161
00:14:19,263 --> 00:14:20,695
I'd be mad too if I were her

162
00:14:20,922 --> 00:14:22,584
She's a prefect, after all

163
00:14:22,682 --> 00:14:23,568
You really shouldn't have either

164
00:14:23,608 --> 00:14:25,428
Why did you put a phone in her bag out of nowhere?

165
00:14:25,542 --> 00:14:27,836
Ugh, how was I supposed to know she couldn't bring it?

166
00:14:27,876 --> 00:14:30,477
I just thought the neighborhood's been unsafe lately

167
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,197
You're welcome

168
00:14:58,167 --> 00:14:59,345
Let me help you

169
00:15:09,754 --> 00:15:11,361
Let me wipe it

170
00:15:12,001 --> 00:15:14,084
It had nothing to do with you anyway

171
00:15:15,126 --> 00:15:18,106
The teacher punished me, not you

172
00:15:18,876 --> 00:15:20,712
You're the class monitor, after all

173
00:15:32,209 --> 00:15:33,261
Thank you

174
00:16:25,331 --> 00:16:27,410
Your bra is hooked wrong

175
00:16:34,459 --> 00:16:36,479
Girls, attention

176
00:16:36,876 --> 00:16:39,044
This class we'll be doing ballroom dancing

177
00:16:39,084 --> 00:16:41,780
Pair up in groups of two

178
00:16:45,292 --> 00:16:47,001
Once you've paired up, sit down

179
00:16:53,751 --> 00:16:55,242
How's it going? All sorted yet?

180
00:16:59,959 --> 00:17:01,459
I'll come in and dance with you then

181
00:17:03,933 --> 00:17:12,913
One, two, three...

182
00:17:12,987 --> 00:17:22,101
One, two, three...

183
00:17:22,142 --> 00:17:23,355
One...

184
00:17:23,834 --> 00:17:25,182
Who's the guy, who's the girl?

185
00:17:25,789 --> 00:17:26,252
Guy

186
00:17:26,292 --> 00:17:27,829
If you're the guy, put your hand on her waist

187
00:17:28,209 --> 00:17:29,372
Straighten your back

188
00:17:29,959 --> 00:17:31,107
One

189
00:17:31,607 --> 00:17:32,820
Relax

190
00:17:33,916 --> 00:17:36,335
Okay, guys and girls swap

191
00:17:36,376 --> 00:17:38,752
Don't get it? You don't even get swapping guy and girl?

192
00:17:38,792 --> 00:17:39,885
Begin

193
00:17:40,376 --> 00:17:43,022
One, two

194
00:17:43,362 --> 00:17:44,508
Three

195
00:17:48,917 --> 00:17:50,415
Get closer

196
00:17:51,959 --> 00:17:56,116
One, two, three

197
00:18:07,751 --> 00:18:08,930
Don't get me wrong

198
00:18:08,971 --> 00:18:10,568
I didn't actually accept her

199
00:18:11,042 --> 00:18:12,834
But I didn't reject her either

200
00:18:13,417 --> 00:18:14,336
And just like that

201
00:18:14,376 --> 00:18:17,692
we kept this relationship going for nearly a term

202
00:18:18,153 --> 00:18:21,459
As if by tacit agreement, neither of us ever brought that incident up again

203
00:18:21,827 --> 00:18:23,710
We went back to how we were before

204
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:25,356
really pure best friends

205
00:18:26,592 --> 00:18:27,679
Uh...

206
00:18:28,042 --> 00:18:29,128
I suppose

207
00:18:46,876 --> 00:18:49,187
Prefect, aren't you going to lock up?

208
00:18:52,667 --> 00:18:53,549
Oh

209
00:19:02,694 --> 00:19:04,319
Oops, it's stuck

210
00:19:23,218 --> 00:19:24,358
Let's go

211
00:19:26,126 --> 00:19:28,252
Why are you leaving? Isn't it good?

212
00:19:28,293 --> 00:19:30,479
It is, which is why I'm stopping

213
00:19:30,792 --> 00:19:31,684
Why?

214
00:19:31,751 --> 00:19:32,825
Because it's so good

215
00:19:32,866 --> 00:19:34,669
I don't want to finish it all at once

216
00:19:34,709 --> 00:19:36,362
I want to go home and imagine

217
00:19:36,403 --> 00:19:38,155
what the ending might be

218
00:19:38,626 --> 00:19:40,682
Oh, it has my name on it

219
00:19:41,751 --> 00:19:42,960
Must be really expensive

220
00:19:43,707 --> 00:19:44,640
Let's go

221
00:19:44,792 --> 00:19:45,959
You like it?

222
00:19:46,792 --> 00:19:47,924
No

223
00:19:56,573 --> 00:20:01,459
(Out of SMS quota, let's talk on the phone XP)

224
00:20:06,334 --> 00:20:07,413
Hello?

225
00:20:09,459 --> 00:20:10,519
Bro, it's for you

226
00:20:11,113 --> 00:20:12,518
For me?

227
00:20:14,811 --> 00:20:15,851
Call waiting

228
00:20:24,401 --> 00:20:27,376
Kneecap? Can knees even cramp?

229
00:20:27,417 --> 00:20:29,608
Yeah, the tendon is pulled completely tight

230
00:20:29,971 --> 00:20:31,231
It hurts so much...

231
00:20:31,334 --> 00:20:32,780
I'm already pressing really hard

232
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:33,372
{\an8}Harder

233
00:20:32,820 --> 00:20:34,159
Hey, so what should I say?

234
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:35,606
I just told you

235
00:20:36,693 --> 00:20:37,520
Hello?

236
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:39,319
I'm the parent of Lee Sum-yuet from Class 7A

237
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:41,000
She's feeling really unwell

238
00:20:41,041 --> 00:20:42,544
and would like to take a day off

239
00:20:42,585 --> 00:20:44,002
What's wrong with her?

240
00:20:44,042 --> 00:20:45,959
- A fever
- Food poisoning!

241
00:22:29,249 --> 00:22:30,541
I'm so tired

242
00:22:33,626 --> 00:22:35,245
It's past midnight already

243
00:22:36,887 --> 00:22:38,119
How about we go to sleep?

244
00:22:38,300 --> 00:22:41,542
Okay, I'll hang up then, bye

245
00:22:41,735 --> 00:22:42,896
Bye

246
00:22:45,728 --> 00:22:47,074
See you tomorrow

247
00:22:47,376 --> 00:22:49,803
Okay, bye

248
00:22:50,042 --> 00:22:51,390
Bye

249
00:22:53,667 --> 00:22:55,731
Thought you said you were hanging up

250
00:22:57,459 --> 00:22:58,939
Then why didn't you hang up?

251
00:22:59,292 --> 00:23:01,397
Well, I saw you weren't hanging up

252
00:23:01,778 --> 00:23:03,391
So I didn't hang up either

253
00:23:03,709 --> 00:23:06,569
Well, I saw you didn't hang up either, so I didn't

254
00:23:11,314 --> 00:23:13,292
Is there something you want to tell me?

255
00:23:19,751 --> 00:23:21,105
Nope

256
00:23:21,608 --> 00:23:23,369
We've been talking for so long

257
00:23:23,459 --> 00:23:26,211
Then let's count three, two, one and hang up together

258
00:23:26,406 --> 00:23:27,252
Okay

259
00:23:27,292 --> 00:23:30,399
-Three, two, one
-Three, two, one

260
00:23:31,667 --> 00:23:33,127
You lied to me again

261
00:23:33,167 --> 00:23:35,042
No, I didn't

262
00:23:41,292 --> 00:23:42,561
Where are your parents?

263
00:23:42,709 --> 00:23:44,127
They're not back yet

264
00:23:44,167 --> 00:23:45,267
Okay

265
00:23:53,130 --> 00:23:54,804
What are we watching today?

266
00:23:55,542 --> 00:23:57,610
We're not watching today, we're shooting

267
00:23:57,677 --> 00:23:58,624
Shooting what?

268
00:24:00,262 --> 00:24:03,195
The 50 most iconic scenes in cinema

269
00:24:03,382 --> 00:24:04,389
Where's your camera?

270
00:24:04,430 --> 00:24:05,429
Wait a sec

271
00:24:09,834 --> 00:24:11,355
Woah

272
00:24:11,873 --> 00:24:13,799
It's the latest DV camera

273
00:24:14,337 --> 00:24:16,856
Yeah, my dad specifically got someone to buy it from Japan

274
00:24:19,992 --> 00:24:21,192
What are we waiting for then?

275
00:24:21,417 --> 00:24:22,367
Action!

276
00:24:25,623 --> 00:24:27,383
There's a bad guy on the left now, on the left

277
00:24:27,424 --> 00:24:28,769
Walk over and shoot him

278
00:24:28,856 --> 00:24:29,989
Pull him over

279
00:24:30,167 --> 00:24:31,376
Push him off

280
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:34,273
And then you almost do the splits

281
00:24:35,483 --> 00:24:36,850
Almost did it

282
00:24:36,931 --> 00:24:38,222
Keep looking cool

283
00:24:38,343 --> 00:24:39,432
Bomb incoming!

284
00:24:39,519 --> 00:24:40,966
Roll away, roll away!

285
00:24:41,539 --> 00:24:42,633
Good take!

286
00:24:56,716 --> 00:24:58,123
What do you actually want?

287
00:24:59,001 --> 00:25:00,696
I want to be friends with you

288
00:25:01,709 --> 00:25:03,667
Why should I be friends with you?

289
00:25:09,568 --> 00:25:11,783
Look at my... clock

290
00:25:13,090 --> 00:25:14,687
Why should I look at your...

291
00:25:15,798 --> 00:25:16,926
...clock?

292
00:25:19,620 --> 00:25:20,866
Just for one minute

293
00:25:29,292 --> 00:25:31,265
It doesn't even have a second hand

294
00:25:34,001 --> 00:25:35,253
Well, you're an actor

295
00:25:35,294 --> 00:25:36,707
Use some imagination

296
00:25:41,215 --> 00:25:43,548
Well, it really doesn't have one

297
00:27:18,483 --> 00:27:20,343
What's wrong with your lips?

298
00:27:20,376 --> 00:27:21,010
Can you see it?

299
00:27:21,050 --> 00:27:22,044
-They're all swollen
-I know, right?

300
00:27:22,084 --> 00:27:23,182
What happened?

301
00:27:24,912 --> 00:27:26,305
Yours is like that too?

302
00:27:26,933 --> 00:27:28,937
Look at your lips, both of you

303
00:27:28,999 --> 00:27:30,813
- Like a bee sting, right?
- Right?

304
00:27:30,933 --> 00:27:32,593
- It's so red
- Oh my god

305
00:27:34,769 --> 00:27:35,536
...to you

306
00:27:35,576 --> 00:27:38,086
Happy birthday to Lee Sum-yuet

307
00:27:38,199 --> 00:27:40,362
Happy birthday to you

308
00:27:42,126 --> 00:27:44,520
Hey, what did you just wish for?

309
00:27:45,459 --> 00:27:48,376
I hope I get into film school next year

310
00:27:49,084 --> 00:27:52,504
And get to make a story of my own in the future

311
00:27:53,042 --> 00:27:56,153
Wow, so cool

312
00:27:56,876 --> 00:27:58,523
Are you teasing me?

313
00:27:59,167 --> 00:28:00,786
I mean it

314
00:28:02,709 --> 00:28:03,794
Have you ever thought

315
00:28:03,834 --> 00:28:06,532
that our lives are each independent movies?

316
00:28:08,577 --> 00:28:11,179
Except in my movie, you're the lead

317
00:28:12,167 --> 00:28:13,825
And in yours

318
00:28:14,751 --> 00:28:16,488
I might just be a supporting character

319
00:28:17,792 --> 00:28:19,105
Once you go to uni

320
00:28:19,560 --> 00:28:21,626
you'll forget all about me

321
00:28:23,532 --> 00:28:24,825
No, I won't

322
00:28:25,542 --> 00:28:27,312
I definitely won't

323
00:28:31,459 --> 00:28:33,086
How do you know?

324
00:28:33,126 --> 00:28:34,783
Just because you say so?

325
00:28:37,376 --> 00:28:40,001
Lee Sum-yuet, let's make a promise

326
00:28:41,917 --> 00:28:43,251
Promise what?

327
00:28:44,417 --> 00:28:46,751
Next year we have to get into the same uni

328
00:28:47,501 --> 00:28:50,545
And every year, I'll celebrate your birthday here with you

329
00:28:52,376 --> 00:28:53,563
Okay

330
00:28:54,029 --> 00:28:55,343
You promised

331
00:29:01,154 --> 00:29:03,368
Prefects, huh? Prefects, huh?

332
00:29:07,376 --> 00:29:08,312
What?

333
00:29:14,147 --> 00:29:15,165
Get back inside

334
00:29:16,376 --> 00:29:18,961
Sigh, I knew there was something going on between them

335
00:29:19,001 --> 00:29:20,127
Not anymore

336
00:29:20,167 --> 00:29:21,941
Even the principal got involved

337
00:29:30,334 --> 00:29:31,834
I'm scared

338
00:29:33,891 --> 00:29:35,391
Why?

339
00:29:43,917 --> 00:29:47,262
I can never stop thinking about you

340
00:29:52,876 --> 00:29:54,605
Doing homework

341
00:29:55,359 --> 00:29:57,147
In class

342
00:29:58,781 --> 00:30:00,421
Eating

343
00:30:02,360 --> 00:30:04,007
Showering

344
00:30:05,126 --> 00:30:06,780
Using the bathroom

345
00:30:08,751 --> 00:30:10,714
I'm always thinking about you

346
00:30:24,615 --> 00:30:25,968
Lee Wing-lam

347
00:30:30,001 --> 00:30:31,917
I think in this world

348
00:30:33,979 --> 00:30:35,911
only you're silly enough

349
00:30:39,417 --> 00:30:41,376
to think I'm that important

350
00:30:45,084 --> 00:30:46,555
Besides you

351
00:30:47,129 --> 00:30:49,049
there won't be anyone else

352
00:30:52,542 --> 00:30:53,834
Lee Sum-yuet

353
00:30:59,244 --> 00:31:00,764
Whatever happens in the future

354
00:31:03,292 --> 00:31:05,167
I will never forget you

355
00:31:19,876 --> 00:31:21,927
I don't care about the future

356
00:31:23,792 --> 00:31:26,072
I think right now is already great

357
00:31:33,751 --> 00:31:35,667
I think so too

358
00:32:30,209 --> 00:32:31,388
I do

359
00:32:32,376 --> 00:32:33,638
I do

360
00:32:53,709 --> 00:32:56,309
Thank you, Miss Mak

361
00:33:00,084 --> 00:33:02,495
Now, history tells us

362
00:33:02,536 --> 00:33:05,186
that life is about constantly making mistakes

363
00:33:05,292 --> 00:33:08,359
But we can learn and grow from our mistakes

364
00:33:07,519 --> 00:33:08,799
{\an8}Sorry to interrupt

365
00:33:13,312 --> 00:33:15,479
Lee Sum-yuet, Lee Wing-lam

366
00:33:15,626 --> 00:33:17,372
Step outside with Miss Chan for a moment

367
00:33:22,225 --> 00:33:24,377
The principal is meeting with your parents inside

368
00:33:24,417 --> 00:33:26,163
Why don't you sit here and wait?

369
00:33:54,516 --> 00:33:55,356
{\an8}Mom...

370
00:33:54,751 --> 00:33:56,669
I don't feel so well

371
00:33:56,756 --> 00:33:58,599
I'm a bit dizzy, and I really need to pee

372
00:33:58,640 --> 00:33:59,669
So are you dizzy or do you need to pee?

373
00:33:59,709 --> 00:34:00,669
I don't know

374
00:34:00,709 --> 00:34:02,917
Let me take Mom to the restroom first

375
00:34:03,302 --> 00:34:04,021
This way

376
00:34:04,062 --> 00:34:05,105
-Hold on to Mom
-Okay

377
00:34:05,902 --> 00:34:07,120
Careful

378
00:34:10,415 --> 00:34:11,456
Dad

379
00:34:11,626 --> 00:34:13,029
We'll talk when we get home

380
00:34:14,388 --> 00:34:16,588
I'll go back up to get my schoolbag then

381
00:34:19,442 --> 00:34:20,533
Is that your daughter?

382
00:34:21,376 --> 00:34:22,194
Is that your daughter?

383
00:34:22,235 --> 00:34:23,110
Yeah

384
00:34:23,313 --> 00:34:24,293
Hey... thanks a lot, thank you

385
00:34:24,334 --> 00:34:25,285
It's all good

386
00:34:26,686 --> 00:34:27,603
Thanks a lot

387
00:34:30,100 --> 00:34:31,658
So, what line of work are you in?

388
00:34:31,699 --> 00:34:33,861
I'm a tour guide, leading Japan tours

389
00:34:34,334 --> 00:34:36,834
Nice, working with the Japanese makes good money

390
00:34:36,917 --> 00:34:38,666
Just making a living

391
00:34:38,917 --> 00:34:39,917
What about you?

392
00:34:41,365 --> 00:34:42,762
I used to run a factory

393
00:34:42,942 --> 00:34:44,828
Now I just drive a taxi from time to time

394
00:34:44,908 --> 00:34:46,435
Just a hobby

395
00:34:48,002 --> 00:34:49,569
Though I've got a big project in the works

396
00:34:49,959 --> 00:34:51,167
That's great

397
00:34:52,826 --> 00:34:54,961
By the way, what's the big deal anyway, right?

398
00:34:55,027 --> 00:34:56,403
Making a mountain out of a molehill

399
00:34:56,542 --> 00:34:58,542
If she wasn't the principal, I would've torn into her

400
00:34:58,626 --> 00:35:00,188
I can tell

401
00:35:00,228 --> 00:35:02,339
That old bitch, seriously, damn it

402
00:35:02,988 --> 00:35:05,327
Between two girls, nothing can really happen, right?

403
00:35:05,667 --> 00:35:07,689
If it were with boys, I'd be more worried

404
00:35:07,786 --> 00:35:08,860
If that happened...

405
00:35:09,493 --> 00:35:10,739
Total disaster, right?

406
00:35:11,454 --> 00:35:12,688
Like you said

407
00:35:12,782 --> 00:35:15,247
Why get so worked up over two girls?

408
00:35:15,406 --> 00:35:16,919
She just hasn't been touched by a man yet

409
00:35:16,959 --> 00:35:19,672
Once she has, there's no turning back

410
00:35:19,785 --> 00:35:21,622
Once they try it, there's no going back

411
00:35:21,714 --> 00:35:23,381
Dad, are you done talking?

412
00:35:23,459 --> 00:35:24,669
Oh, coming

413
00:35:24,709 --> 00:35:25,827
See you

414
00:35:40,860 --> 00:35:42,069
I've thought about it

415
00:35:42,459 --> 00:35:43,629
It's all your fault

416
00:35:43,792 --> 00:35:45,162
How is this my fault again?

417
00:35:47,501 --> 00:35:48,504
You like women, don't you?

418
00:35:48,545 --> 00:35:49,336
Yeah

419
00:35:49,376 --> 00:35:51,079
Our daughter just inherited it all from you

420
00:35:51,959 --> 00:35:52,978
You're right

421
00:35:55,449 --> 00:35:57,032
I haven't yelled enough sense into her yet

422
00:35:57,106 --> 00:35:58,258
Let me go up and yell at her some more

423
00:35:58,299 --> 00:36:00,251
You're right, leave the rough stuff to me

424
00:36:00,542 --> 00:36:01,418
You?

425
00:36:02,667 --> 00:36:03,710
Hit her!

426
00:36:05,452 --> 00:36:08,365
[Japanese] You bastard, it's me!

427
00:36:20,292 --> 00:36:22,499
Scared yet? Let's see if you dare try that again

428
00:36:22,876 --> 00:36:25,186
Does it hurt now? If it hurts, why do it, huh?

429
00:36:25,449 --> 00:36:26,899
Out of all the things you could do

430
00:36:26,941 --> 00:36:28,443
why mess around with something like this?

431
00:36:37,610 --> 00:36:39,709
Your mom...

432
00:37:39,820 --> 00:37:40,786
Sit down

433
00:37:57,910 --> 00:37:59,610
Have some cake, take a seat

434
00:38:06,587 --> 00:38:08,628
Do you remember, after your mom left

435
00:38:09,165 --> 00:38:10,849
your dad promised you

436
00:38:11,459 --> 00:38:12,959
I'd definitely make it big

437
00:38:17,626 --> 00:38:19,864
You know your dad has been working really hard

438
00:38:20,646 --> 00:38:22,722
driving two taxi shifts

439
00:38:25,452 --> 00:38:27,652
Before, I actually saved up a few hundred thousand

440
00:38:28,709 --> 00:38:30,260
I thought about going back to my old trade

441
00:38:30,667 --> 00:38:32,620
Children's clothing seemed promising, you know

442
00:38:33,142 --> 00:38:35,339
so I took a loan from a finance company to set it up

443
00:38:37,501 --> 00:38:39,327
Who knew an old friend would scam me out of everything

444
00:38:41,139 --> 00:38:42,748
Who would've thought

445
00:38:43,621 --> 00:38:45,315
he was even worse off than me

446
00:38:45,763 --> 00:38:47,083
Scamming his own buddy

447
00:38:53,431 --> 00:38:54,811
Your dad is useless

448
00:38:55,959 --> 00:38:57,740
Your mom was right to leave

449
00:39:01,751 --> 00:39:03,338
You're all grown up now

450
00:39:04,584 --> 00:39:06,540
You know our family situation very well

451
00:39:07,751 --> 00:39:09,209
Money is tight

452
00:39:10,855 --> 00:39:13,229
So you can't lose that scholarship

453
00:39:14,584 --> 00:39:16,963
The most important thing is to focus on your studies

454
00:39:20,334 --> 00:39:22,336
It's not that your dad minds you hanging out with girls

455
00:39:22,376 --> 00:39:24,377
Your dad likes being around girls too, right?

456
00:39:24,417 --> 00:39:26,367
It's just that they don't like hanging out with me

457
00:39:29,792 --> 00:39:31,255
Eat some cake

458
00:39:38,552 --> 00:39:40,299
Come on, let's eat cake together

459
00:39:46,334 --> 00:39:47,880
I'm sorry, Dad

460
00:39:52,126 --> 00:39:53,084
Good girl

461
00:40:01,633 --> 00:40:02,853
It's really delicious

462
00:40:03,917 --> 00:40:06,042
Eat some more, come on

463
00:40:10,709 --> 00:40:11,720
Tasty, huh?

464
00:40:19,167 --> 00:40:21,584
Hey, she's always sleeping here

465
00:40:21,662 --> 00:40:22,961
Doesn't she have her own home?

466
00:40:23,001 --> 00:40:25,042
Shh, Mom, keep your voice down

467
00:40:25,084 --> 00:40:26,523
She'll hear you

468
00:40:27,334 --> 00:40:28,292
You know what?

469
00:40:30,501 --> 00:40:32,417
I won't be sitting here waiting for you anymore

470
00:40:33,709 --> 00:40:36,459
I kind of guessed that

471
00:40:39,751 --> 00:40:41,001
Honestly

472
00:40:41,629 --> 00:40:43,295
The apartment isn't even renovated yet

473
00:40:44,908 --> 00:40:46,408
You might not believe it

474
00:40:49,126 --> 00:40:50,757
I really do like you

475
00:40:52,616 --> 00:40:54,609
Don't make me cry

476
00:40:56,876 --> 00:40:58,589
You might not know either

477
00:41:01,584 --> 00:41:03,167
I really do like you too

478
00:41:04,709 --> 00:41:06,501
What happens to us after this year?

479
00:41:07,626 --> 00:41:08,696
A-Levels

480
00:41:08,959 --> 00:41:10,917
I mean what will happen to us?

481
00:41:11,417 --> 00:41:13,917
We'll go to university together

482
00:41:14,334 --> 00:41:16,217
Whatever major you study, I'll study too

483
00:41:16,917 --> 00:41:18,990
Have you ever thought about our future?

484
00:41:24,834 --> 00:41:26,334
Not this one?

485
00:41:27,792 --> 00:41:29,526
I never said I wanted it

486
00:41:31,637 --> 00:41:33,114
Then I'll take it back

487
00:41:38,122 --> 00:41:39,731
Then I'll throw it away

488
00:41:43,595 --> 00:41:44,839
I'm throwing it away

489
00:41:46,216 --> 00:41:47,289
I'm really throwing it away!

490
00:41:47,330 --> 00:41:48,343
Lee Wing-lam

491
00:41:58,501 --> 00:41:59,616
What?

492
00:42:04,019 --> 00:42:06,066
Actually, I think Sister was right

493
00:42:07,066 --> 00:42:08,272
Like...

494
00:42:08,312 --> 00:42:10,376
this kind of confusion in an all-girls school...

495
00:42:11,422 --> 00:42:13,048
it happens all the time

496
00:42:13,996 --> 00:42:15,705
Maybe it's just an illusion

497
00:42:16,541 --> 00:42:19,287
Once we grow up, we'll think it was...

498
00:42:20,338 --> 00:42:21,633
so silly

499
00:42:21,906 --> 00:42:23,179
so childish

500
00:42:26,492 --> 00:42:28,220
If loving you is childish...

501
00:42:28,376 --> 00:42:30,126
I'd rather never grow up

502
00:42:33,483 --> 00:42:35,011
You just don't get it

503
00:42:36,709 --> 00:42:38,629
You're the one who doesn't get it!

504
00:42:39,516 --> 00:42:42,276
Do you know how hard I worked to buy this ring?

505
00:42:43,709 --> 00:42:45,341
Walking to school every day

506
00:42:45,751 --> 00:42:47,430
Eating hot dogs for months

507
00:42:48,459 --> 00:42:50,136
I even spent all my red packet money

508
00:42:52,171 --> 00:42:53,823
But as long as I thought about

509
00:42:54,341 --> 00:42:56,496
when you received this ring...

510
00:42:58,334 --> 00:42:59,657
how happy you'd be...

511
00:43:02,376 --> 00:43:03,169
it was all worth it

512
00:43:03,215 --> 00:43:04,745
Nobody asked you to buy it!

513
00:43:18,649 --> 00:43:19,683
Yeah

514
00:43:21,709 --> 00:43:23,030
Nobody asked me to buy it

515
00:43:25,443 --> 00:43:27,221
Nobody asked me to treat you so well

516
00:43:29,463 --> 00:43:31,181
Nobody asked me to like you so much

517
00:43:33,479 --> 00:43:35,742
I brought it all on myself, happy now?

518
00:43:38,696 --> 00:43:40,472
Don't be like this

519
00:43:49,206 --> 00:43:50,328
I don't get it either

520
00:43:51,709 --> 00:43:53,082
As long as you like me and I like you...

521
00:43:53,123 --> 00:43:55,292
what in the world can't we work out?

522
00:44:04,769 --> 00:44:07,117
Then what do you think we are right now?

523
00:44:12,445 --> 00:44:13,732
Good friends

524
00:44:16,751 --> 00:44:18,726
I don't understand what "good friends" means!

525
00:44:22,001 --> 00:44:24,780
Do good friends hold hands, hug, and kiss?

526
00:44:31,213 --> 00:44:32,813
Why can't they?

527
00:44:40,334 --> 00:44:41,760
Don't be like this

528
00:44:43,751 --> 00:44:45,072
You know what?

529
00:44:46,667 --> 00:44:48,688
You will always be my...

530
00:44:48,728 --> 00:44:51,155
best, best...

531
00:44:51,235 --> 00:44:52,868
best friend

532
00:44:53,663 --> 00:44:55,449
That will never change

533
00:45:45,751 --> 00:45:47,025
Since you...

534
00:45:50,903 --> 00:45:53,070
you're so unhappy being with me...

535
00:45:59,792 --> 00:46:01,042
why don't we...

536
00:46:45,368 --> 00:46:46,708
Lee Sum-yuet

537
00:47:00,387 --> 00:47:01,762
Lee Sum-yuet!

538
00:47:16,743 --> 00:47:18,582
Now the whole school has seen it

539
00:47:21,715 --> 00:47:23,795
Yeah, so what?

540
00:48:30,401 --> 00:48:33,096
As a prefect, the teachers are really disappointed in you

541
00:48:34,459 --> 00:48:36,459
Lee Sum-yuet has already written her apology letter

542
00:48:36,721 --> 00:48:38,615
You should reflect on yourself too

543
00:48:39,501 --> 00:48:41,211
Lee Wing-lam has already finished

544
00:48:41,251 --> 00:48:43,167
Stop wasting time

545
00:48:45,834 --> 00:48:47,959
If I write it, will you not notify my parents?

546
00:49:14,209 --> 00:49:15,211
I am...

547
00:49:15,251 --> 00:49:16,709
Louder!

548
00:49:17,584 --> 00:49:19,986
I am from Class 7A

549
00:49:21,283 --> 00:49:24,683
number 22, Lee Wing-lam

550
00:49:27,485 --> 00:49:29,171
Keep reading!

551
00:49:32,811 --> 00:49:35,879
After deep reflection

552
00:49:38,950 --> 00:49:40,749
for what happened today

553
00:49:40,822 --> 00:49:45,544
with Lee Sum-yuet from Class 7A

554
00:49:45,584 --> 00:49:47,987
fooling around

555
00:49:48,376 --> 00:49:52,264
on the playground

556
00:49:52,411 --> 00:49:54,906
and breaching school discipline

557
00:49:54,947 --> 00:49:58,230
I feel ashamed

558
00:49:58,676 --> 00:50:00,240
and disgraceful

559
00:50:11,679 --> 00:50:13,109
What are you doing?

560
00:50:16,133 --> 00:50:16,879
Hey...

561
00:50:18,501 --> 00:50:21,502
Lee Sum-yuet and I have no intimate relationship

562
00:50:21,542 --> 00:50:22,566
I

563
00:50:22,766 --> 00:50:25,160
Class 7A, number 21

565
00:50:24,393 --> 00:50:26,159
{\an8}From now on

564
00:50:25,287 --> 00:50:26,580
Lee Sum-yuet

566
00:50:27,579 --> 00:50:29,866
For what happened today

567
00:50:30,001 --> 00:50:32,834
I am willing to take full responsibility alone

568
00:50:34,126 --> 00:50:36,970
None of this has anything to do with Lee Wing-lam

569
00:52:00,917 --> 00:52:02,667
Did you think I would die?

570
00:52:03,001 --> 00:52:04,315
How could I?

571
00:52:04,876 --> 00:52:06,308
Right now

572
00:52:06,584 --> 00:52:08,607
I can't control anything at all

573
00:52:09,475 --> 00:52:10,962
Not her leaving

574
00:52:11,376 --> 00:52:13,021
not my emotions

575
00:52:13,292 --> 00:52:15,761
or the way the world sees us

576
00:52:17,277 --> 00:52:18,522
Look

577
00:52:18,562 --> 00:52:21,174
I don't even have the power to control a dream

578
00:52:22,292 --> 00:52:23,662
Suddenly

579
00:52:24,426 --> 00:52:26,584
I feel so small

580
00:52:28,417 --> 00:52:31,874
During this time, it felt like so much happened

581
00:52:32,840 --> 00:52:35,192
Yet it also felt like nothing happened at all

582
00:52:36,354 --> 00:52:38,812
Actually, I tried looking for her several times

583
00:52:39,567 --> 00:52:42,252
It's hard to imagine in a place like Hong Kong

584
00:52:42,292 --> 00:52:43,574
a person

585
00:52:43,853 --> 00:52:46,521
could disappear so completely

586
00:52:47,751 --> 00:52:49,334
Sometimes I wonder

587
00:52:50,126 --> 00:52:52,567
is it that I just refuse to accept reality

588
00:52:53,876 --> 00:52:55,951
or was everything between us

589
00:52:56,334 --> 00:52:58,373
never more than just a dream?

590
00:53:01,209 --> 00:53:03,844
I really want to write an apology letter

591
00:53:04,167 --> 00:53:07,516
to regret ever writing an apology letter like that

592
00:53:14,126 --> 00:53:16,240
So this feeling of being completely blank

593
00:53:17,251 --> 00:53:18,427
is like this

594
00:53:18,834 --> 00:53:21,743
I thought I wouldn't survive this end of the world

595
00:53:23,340 --> 00:53:24,820
Until one day

596
00:53:25,867 --> 00:53:27,746
I realized the heartbroken ones

597
00:53:28,768 --> 00:53:30,147
weren't just me

598
00:54:40,858 --> 00:54:42,997
Today is February 3rd, the third day of the Lunar New Year

599
00:54:43,038 --> 00:54:44,730
Secretary for Home Affairs Patrick Ho

600
00:54:44,771 --> 00:54:46,711
went to Che Kung Temple to pray for Hong Kong

601
00:54:46,751 --> 00:54:47,586
This evening

602
00:54:47,626 --> 00:54:49,461
a Chinese man surnamed Cheung

603
00:54:49,501 --> 00:54:51,677
fell from a height at a hotel in Central

604
00:54:51,718 --> 00:54:53,445
{\an8}and was certified dead upon arrival at the hospital...

605
00:54:51,938 --> 00:54:54,005
Prince of Wales Hospital in Sha Tin confirmed that

606
00:54:54,046 --> 00:54:57,126
two healthcare workers are showing pneumonia symptoms

607
00:54:57,709 --> 00:54:58,919
Some say that year

608
00:54:58,959 --> 00:55:00,794
for many people in Hong Kong

609
00:55:00,834 --> 00:55:02,717
was full of moments worth remembering

610
00:55:03,626 --> 00:55:04,670
And for me

611
00:55:05,573 --> 00:55:07,346
all I remember is a bunch of texts

612
00:55:07,682 --> 00:55:09,439
rows of English letters

613
00:55:10,042 --> 00:55:12,522
this "relaxing" music that made me so anxious

614
00:55:13,824 --> 00:55:15,224
and that one date

615
00:55:16,750 --> 00:55:20,053
Everyone has their own way of getting closure

616
00:55:20,292 --> 00:55:21,913
So I decided

617
00:55:22,292 --> 00:55:25,113
that if she didn't show up by the count of three

618
00:55:25,417 --> 00:55:27,934
I would truly let her go

619
00:55:29,135 --> 00:55:30,268
Three

620
00:55:31,074 --> 00:55:32,074
Two

621
00:55:32,956 --> 00:55:33,956
One

622
00:55:34,626 --> 00:55:35,905
Lee Sum-yuet

623
00:55:36,278 --> 00:55:37,697
Happy birthday

624
00:55:39,292 --> 00:55:40,794
We are...

625
00:55:40,834 --> 00:55:43,043
We twelve from the society

626
00:55:43,084 --> 00:55:44,463
will do our absolute best for you...

627
00:55:44,510 --> 00:55:47,086
In an era when social media was starting to rise

628
00:55:47,126 --> 00:55:48,864
I finally found Lee Sum-yuet again

629
00:55:49,842 --> 00:55:52,058
I admit I broke our promise

630
00:55:52,850 --> 00:55:55,324
But seeing that she really got into film school

631
00:55:55,549 --> 00:55:57,281
I was truly happy for her

632
00:56:01,584 --> 00:56:02,572
What are you doing?

633
00:56:02,709 --> 00:56:04,127
The lighting looked nice just now

634
00:56:04,167 --> 00:56:05,439
I couldn't help taking a photo

635
00:56:08,584 --> 00:56:09,709
Hey

636
00:56:11,867 --> 00:56:13,421
If you develop that, I'm warning you

637
00:56:22,059 --> 00:56:24,298
So disgusting! Someone stole two pairs of my stockings

638
00:56:24,339 --> 00:56:26,086
Two of my bras went missing too

639
00:56:26,126 --> 00:56:28,306
There's definitely a creep in the dorm

640
00:56:46,403 --> 00:56:47,489
Stealing my undies?

641
00:56:47,530 --> 00:56:48,210
Are you a pervert?

642
00:56:48,250 --> 00:56:50,510
Pervert...

643
00:56:51,323 --> 00:56:52,996
Crazy, you're crazy, hey!

644
00:56:55,723 --> 00:56:57,023
What are you doing?

645
00:56:57,084 --> 00:56:58,382
Why are you stealing my underwear?

646
00:56:58,423 --> 00:57:00,057
I didn't! Where'd you even get that?

647
00:57:00,098 --> 00:57:01,323
Still denying it?

648
00:57:01,364 --> 00:57:03,038
Then why are you sneaking around here?

649
00:57:05,084 --> 00:57:05,649
Oh

650
00:57:05,689 --> 00:57:07,919
Can't answer? That means you did it, I'm telling the warden

651
00:57:07,959 --> 00:57:08,945
No, please...

652
00:57:08,986 --> 00:57:10,711
Actually, my own underwear is inside

653
00:57:10,751 --> 00:57:11,866
How could that be?

654
00:57:12,917 --> 00:57:14,277
Look for yourself

655
00:57:21,944 --> 00:57:23,744
The blue ones are mine

656
00:57:27,850 --> 00:57:29,890
Damn it, now I have to wash them all over again

657
00:57:32,122 --> 00:57:33,361
And just like that

658
00:57:33,402 --> 00:57:34,383
I never expected this guy

659
00:57:34,423 --> 00:57:36,752
who lost a game of Truth or Dare at O-Camp

660
00:57:36,792 --> 00:57:38,076
would become the very first

661
00:57:38,117 --> 00:57:39,996
The first guy friend I ever made

662
00:57:45,276 --> 00:57:46,476
Are you scared?

663
00:57:49,834 --> 00:57:51,044
I'm not

664
00:57:51,084 --> 00:57:52,292
Here, you can hold it

665
00:57:53,584 --> 00:57:55,689
You're about to crush the seat

666
00:57:56,852 --> 00:57:58,145
Shut up

667
00:58:09,542 --> 00:58:12,784
What do you think... we are?

668
00:58:16,367 --> 00:58:17,709
Good buddies

669
00:58:19,574 --> 00:58:21,192
Just good buddies?

670
00:58:22,312 --> 00:58:23,614
Why do you ask?

671
00:58:28,001 --> 00:58:29,501
What if I said...

672
00:58:31,209 --> 00:58:33,382
...I didn't want us to just be buddies?

673
00:58:45,050 --> 00:58:46,092
Scared?

674
00:58:49,304 --> 00:58:50,845
What you said was scarier

675
00:58:52,720 --> 00:58:54,127
I was just kidding

676
00:58:54,480 --> 00:58:55,560
Were you really scared?

677
00:58:56,262 --> 00:58:57,555
Did I really fool you?

678
00:58:57,959 --> 00:58:59,211
You're so lame

679
00:58:59,251 --> 00:59:01,188
What's wrong with you, always messing around?

680
00:59:03,838 --> 00:59:04,963
Sorry

681
00:59:05,292 --> 00:59:06,294
Shush yourself

682
00:59:06,334 --> 00:59:07,419
Shush yourself

683
00:59:07,459 --> 00:59:10,037
- So noisy
- You're always so easy to fool

684
00:59:18,903 --> 00:59:20,336
Come out...

685
00:59:20,966 --> 00:59:21,933
Come out...

686
00:59:27,718 --> 00:59:29,362
Only now do I realise

687
00:59:29,462 --> 00:59:31,711
that treating a guy the same way

688
00:59:31,751 --> 00:59:33,595
I treated friends at an all-girls school

689
00:59:33,841 --> 00:59:35,568
could cause misunderstandings

690
00:59:36,376 --> 00:59:38,829
So lately, even with huge gaps between classes

691
00:59:38,949 --> 00:59:40,982
I try to spend as little time at school as possible

692
00:59:41,459 --> 00:59:43,103
to avoid the awkwardness

693
00:59:44,292 --> 00:59:46,042
Little did I expect that at this moment

694
00:59:46,167 --> 00:59:49,300
I'd run into the person I wanted to see most

695
00:59:49,775 --> 00:59:52,255
yet least should have seen

696
01:00:00,917 --> 01:00:02,001
Hey

697
01:00:14,512 --> 01:00:16,967
That night, we talked for a long time

698
01:00:17,353 --> 01:00:20,074
catching up on two years of unsaid words

699
01:00:21,099 --> 01:00:22,502
At first, I was really happy

700
01:00:22,543 --> 01:00:25,074
that we could finally talk so naturally again

701
01:00:26,489 --> 01:00:28,420
Until she told me

702
01:00:31,364 --> 01:00:32,572
I'm seeing someone

703
01:00:33,680 --> 01:00:35,091
A guy

704
01:00:39,872 --> 01:00:41,039
Holding hands?

705
01:00:43,857 --> 01:00:44,940
Kissing?

706
01:00:47,107 --> 01:00:47,982
Mm

707
01:00:53,917 --> 01:00:55,100
Then...

708
01:00:57,623 --> 01:00:58,752
We did it

709
01:01:10,505 --> 01:01:11,848
How did it feel?

710
01:01:24,705 --> 01:01:25,942
Time for me to go

711
01:01:27,074 --> 01:01:29,441
My boyfriend is waiting outside for me

712
01:01:37,167 --> 01:01:38,577
Give me a present

713
01:01:42,298 --> 01:01:43,744
Give me a pair of earrings

714
01:01:44,082 --> 01:01:45,437
You don't even have your ears pierced

715
01:01:45,679 --> 01:01:46,819
What do you want them for?

716
01:01:47,209 --> 01:01:48,692
I just want them

717
01:02:05,476 --> 01:02:07,536
I'm going, bye

718
01:02:53,845 --> 01:02:55,054
What are you doing?

719
01:03:01,376 --> 01:03:02,805
Do you like me?

720
01:03:04,459 --> 01:03:06,649
Come back down, it's dangerous!

721
01:03:14,186 --> 01:03:15,269
Hey

722
01:04:18,990 --> 01:04:20,473
Ever since that night

723
01:04:20,567 --> 01:04:22,382
I never wore a skirt again

724
01:04:30,104 --> 01:04:31,419
Here are those CDs you wanted last time

725
01:04:31,459 --> 01:04:33,627
So generous? Are you not planning on coming back?

726
01:04:33,667 --> 01:04:35,000
Alright, I'm heading off...

727
01:04:35,041 --> 01:04:36,773
- Bye
- Bye

728
01:04:49,252 --> 01:04:52,179
Once you're in the US, get a foreign girlfriend and brush up on your English

729
01:04:53,880 --> 01:04:55,705
If you ever want a boyfriend...

730
01:04:56,742 --> 01:04:58,052
remember to look for me

731
01:05:01,627 --> 01:05:02,447
Time to go

732
01:05:02,488 --> 01:05:03,414
I'm off...

733
01:05:03,454 --> 01:05:05,907
- Bye...
- Bye...

734
01:05:05,948 --> 01:05:09,686
- Bye...
- Bye...

735
01:05:11,042 --> 01:05:12,389
I'm leaving

736
01:05:12,529 --> 01:05:14,777
Bye, don't miss me too much!

737
01:05:49,699 --> 01:05:51,454
Hey, you're sneaking food again!

738
01:05:52,007 --> 01:05:54,427
Can't you just cook your own? Always sneaking bites

739
01:05:55,941 --> 01:05:56,982
Hello?

740
01:06:00,296 --> 01:06:01,809
Where are you? I'll come over right away

741
01:06:19,827 --> 01:06:22,173
The patient suffered a sudden heart attack

742
01:06:22,251 --> 01:06:23,461
and collapsed in the car

743
01:06:23,501 --> 01:06:25,221
By the time he arrived, it was already too late

744
01:06:25,417 --> 01:06:26,958
We did everything we could

745
01:06:27,001 --> 01:06:28,084
Take care

746
01:07:25,001 --> 01:07:27,004
This watch has been inaccurate for a long time

747
01:07:29,719 --> 01:07:32,761
But servicing it costs thousands of dollars, so he couldn't bear to spend it

748
01:07:36,078 --> 01:07:38,526
He said watches aren't for telling time

749
01:07:39,812 --> 01:07:41,507
They're for showing off to people

750
01:07:46,825 --> 01:07:48,586
Actually, he really loved me

751
01:07:49,646 --> 01:07:51,604
He just never said it out loud, that's all

752
01:07:56,672 --> 01:07:59,255
The cheesecake I like is really expensive

753
01:08:00,574 --> 01:08:02,449
He took the initiative to buy it for me twice

754
01:08:04,792 --> 01:08:06,959
The first time was when Mom left

755
01:08:10,117 --> 01:08:12,561
He held the cake in front of me and told me

756
01:08:12,610 --> 01:08:14,626
Mom was never coming back

757
01:08:17,165 --> 01:08:20,090
The second time was when we met the principal at school

758
01:08:21,199 --> 01:08:23,014
He didn't scold me at all

759
01:08:27,492 --> 01:08:29,174
For some reason...

760
01:08:30,454 --> 01:08:31,751
my favourite thing to eat...

761
01:08:31,792 --> 01:08:34,491
only ever appears when I'm at my saddest

762
01:08:40,877 --> 01:08:42,444
Right now in my mouth...

763
01:08:45,998 --> 01:08:47,981
that taste has returned

764
01:09:02,799 --> 01:09:05,356
Earlier, the moment I found out something happened to my dad...

765
01:09:05,721 --> 01:09:07,716
I don't know why, but you were the first person I called

766
01:09:10,514 --> 01:09:11,763
Don't worry

767
01:09:12,230 --> 01:09:13,423
I'm okay

768
01:09:16,501 --> 01:09:17,836
What about your boyfriend?

769
01:09:17,876 --> 01:09:19,542
Is someone going back with you?

770
01:09:24,084 --> 01:09:25,459
We broke up

771
01:09:47,394 --> 01:09:49,389
Which of you is the family representative?

772
01:10:30,677 --> 01:10:31,857
Sum-yuet

773
01:10:32,042 --> 01:10:33,750
Come to the US with me

774
01:10:34,001 --> 01:10:35,383
Let me take care of you guys

775
01:10:36,049 --> 01:10:37,549
I promised Dad

776
01:10:38,542 --> 01:10:40,222
I would take care of them myself

777
01:10:40,863 --> 01:10:42,423
You're still studying

778
01:10:42,490 --> 01:10:44,262
How can you take care of them?

779
01:10:46,350 --> 01:10:49,214
Since we never needed your care in the past...

780
01:10:50,328 --> 01:10:51,822
we don't need it now either

781
01:10:59,791 --> 01:11:01,105
Sum-yuet

782
01:11:02,639 --> 01:11:04,192
I'm your mother

783
01:11:05,558 --> 01:11:08,325
Could you please stop treating me like a stranger?

784
01:11:11,584 --> 01:11:13,376
If you were really family

785
01:11:14,126 --> 01:11:15,860
you would've walked in just now

786
01:11:32,367 --> 01:11:34,075
Let big sis cook something for you guys

787
01:11:34,712 --> 01:11:36,052
No need

788
01:11:36,399 --> 01:11:38,439
The two of us will go downstairs to eat

789
01:11:41,358 --> 01:11:43,384
I'm not hungry, you two go eat first

790
01:11:46,001 --> 01:11:47,332
Be careful out there

791
01:11:47,417 --> 01:11:48,445
Got it

792
01:11:50,617 --> 01:11:51,867
I'll help you pack

793
01:11:59,626 --> 01:12:01,141
I'll go take a shower first then

794
01:12:31,405 --> 01:12:33,298
Stop trying to be strong

795
01:12:44,855 --> 01:12:48,587
I'm scared, I'm so scared

796
01:12:49,202 --> 01:12:51,522
I know, don't be scared

797
01:12:53,218 --> 01:12:54,563
I know you need me right now

798
01:12:54,603 --> 01:12:56,172
Why don't we get back together?

799
01:12:57,079 --> 01:12:59,193
Everything will be fine if we get back together

800
01:13:53,663 --> 01:13:56,064
If by the time we're thirty

801
01:13:58,459 --> 01:14:00,892
we're still alone

802
01:14:04,084 --> 01:14:06,100
let's get married

803
01:14:08,167 --> 01:14:09,751
For now

804
01:14:10,626 --> 01:14:13,058
maybe we shouldn't see each other

805
01:14:17,403 --> 01:14:18,603
Okay

806
01:14:20,417 --> 01:14:22,097
It's a promise

807
01:14:58,292 --> 01:14:59,751
After that night

808
01:15:00,376 --> 01:15:02,238
I never reached out to her again

809
01:15:03,042 --> 01:15:04,813
Later, when I finally had the courage

810
01:15:04,853 --> 01:15:07,209
to check her ICQ info

811
01:15:07,972 --> 01:15:09,817
it turned out she'd stopped going to school

812
01:15:10,285 --> 01:15:11,838
and started working

813
01:15:13,707 --> 01:15:15,063
Lee Wing-lam

814
01:15:15,468 --> 01:15:17,295
Why do you want to switch to Film?

815
01:15:17,342 --> 01:15:19,249
Because I knew a girl

816
01:15:19,626 --> 01:15:21,376
Film was once her dream

817
01:15:22,135 --> 01:15:24,335
but for some reason, she gave it up

818
01:15:24,735 --> 01:15:26,532
I want to keep that dream alive for her

819
01:15:30,618 --> 01:15:34,011
If a film is good, I leave halfway through

820
01:15:34,209 --> 01:15:35,272
come up with an ending myself

821
01:15:35,312 --> 01:15:37,245
and then go back to watch the film again

822
01:15:37,465 --> 01:15:40,662
to compare how my ideas differ from the director's

823
01:15:42,154 --> 01:15:43,368
About five seconds

824
01:15:43,409 --> 01:15:44,367
Three

825
01:15:56,376 --> 01:15:58,429
I wanted to grow up quickly

826
01:15:59,055 --> 01:16:02,202
So after graduating, I moved out right away

827
01:16:02,950 --> 01:16:05,564
I wanted to try living without relying on my family

828
01:16:08,140 --> 01:16:09,419
I remember back in school

829
01:16:09,459 --> 01:16:11,954
I always wanted to get out into the working world

830
01:16:12,334 --> 01:16:14,555
But now that I'm actually working

831
01:16:16,417 --> 01:16:18,329
I want to go back to school

832
01:16:21,334 --> 01:16:22,419
Some say

833
01:16:22,459 --> 01:16:24,967
being diligent is actually a form of laziness

834
01:16:26,209 --> 01:16:27,794
After turning twenty-four

835
01:16:27,834 --> 01:16:30,190
my memory of life became a blur

836
01:16:31,042 --> 01:16:33,377
The most incredible thing about working in film is

837
01:16:33,417 --> 01:16:36,001
it can make you lose all concept of time

838
01:16:38,334 --> 01:16:40,294
I no longer remember during those years

839
01:16:40,334 --> 01:16:41,669
how many productions I worked on

840
01:16:41,710 --> 01:16:43,636
or how many different places I flew to

841
01:16:44,709 --> 01:16:46,936
Until one day, when I was location scouting

842
01:16:47,709 --> 01:16:49,311
and passed by downstairs from her place

843
01:16:51,554 --> 01:16:53,054
All of a sudden

844
01:16:53,126 --> 01:16:55,086
I was terrified that some really important feelings

845
01:16:55,126 --> 01:16:56,778
would be forgotten in the future

846
01:17:06,230 --> 01:17:07,218
Hello?

847
01:17:08,581 --> 01:17:09,565
Hello?

848
01:17:10,595 --> 01:17:11,791
Hello, who's this?

849
01:17:34,834 --> 01:17:36,273
Don't recognize me?

850
01:17:37,501 --> 01:17:39,480
This coming November 15th

851
01:17:40,275 --> 01:17:41,555
I'm getting married

852
01:17:44,417 --> 01:17:45,627
Miss Lee is inside

853
01:17:45,667 --> 01:17:46,695
Thanks

854
01:18:16,256 --> 01:18:17,714
I've been waiting for you for so long

855
01:18:26,791 --> 01:18:27,759
Congratulations!

856
01:18:28,084 --> 01:18:30,116
I didn't get to tell you properly on the phone

857
01:18:30,514 --> 01:18:31,876
I should be the one congratulating you

858
01:18:32,292 --> 01:18:34,212
I heard it's your first time directing

859
01:18:37,782 --> 01:18:39,574
Is working in accounting tough?

860
01:18:40,147 --> 01:18:41,415
It is

861
01:18:41,667 --> 01:18:43,794
I'm helping a client prepare for an IPO right now

862
01:18:44,917 --> 01:18:46,461
And on top of that, planning a wedding

863
01:18:49,229 --> 01:18:50,562
Go try on the bridesmaid dress

864
01:18:53,733 --> 01:18:54,805
Thanks

865
01:19:13,549 --> 01:19:14,619
Shy?

866
01:19:17,472 --> 01:19:19,058
With you? As if!

867
01:19:24,104 --> 01:19:25,658
You really never grow up

868
01:19:25,917 --> 01:19:26,857
Practically thirty years old

869
01:19:26,898 --> 01:19:28,584
and you still wear bras like this?

870
01:19:29,555 --> 01:19:30,596
Well, yeah

871
01:19:30,859 --> 01:19:32,542
You can tell just by looking at my figure

872
01:19:33,595 --> 01:19:34,769
I can tell

873
01:19:49,605 --> 01:19:51,572
Have you always worn your dad's watch?

874
01:19:52,945 --> 01:19:54,669
Ever since he passed away

875
01:19:54,709 --> 01:19:57,105
I've worn it the whole time, never took it off

876
01:20:03,376 --> 01:20:04,459
Ah

877
01:20:05,209 --> 01:20:06,484
Did you do it on purpose?

878
01:20:07,084 --> 01:20:08,697
Ask you to be my bridesmaid on purpose?

879
01:20:10,911 --> 01:20:12,844
Get married before turning thirty on purpose

880
01:20:18,751 --> 01:20:20,167
If I said yes

881
01:20:20,709 --> 01:20:22,009
would you believe me?

882
01:20:28,001 --> 01:20:30,060
Alright, your acting area is right here

883
01:20:30,101 --> 01:20:32,002
And your end mark is roughly here

884
01:20:32,042 --> 01:20:33,187
Turn... that's it...

885
01:20:33,227 --> 01:20:34,167
Alright, you two...

886
01:20:34,522 --> 01:20:35,876
Hello, Director

887
01:20:35,917 --> 01:20:37,711
Would you mind giving us a little teaser

888
01:20:37,751 --> 01:20:40,279
about what the story is roughly about?

889
01:20:43,521 --> 01:20:47,172
Even if two people share a past

890
01:20:47,792 --> 01:20:50,376
they might hold different memories in their hearts

891
01:20:51,001 --> 01:20:52,866
This story of mine is about

892
01:20:53,167 --> 01:20:54,688
a girl

893
01:20:54,807 --> 01:20:56,868
who goes looking for another girl

894
01:20:57,943 --> 01:21:00,927
wanting to confirm if a certain...

895
01:21:01,542 --> 01:21:03,192
shared experience from high school

896
01:21:04,917 --> 01:21:07,459
is remembered the exact same way?

897
01:22:40,088 --> 01:22:41,294
What are you laughing at?

898
01:22:42,862 --> 01:22:44,566
You fastened it wrong again

899
01:23:02,327 --> 01:23:04,052
Do you remember this gift?

900
01:23:07,059 --> 01:23:09,405
Turns out it was in the school lost and found locker all along

901
01:23:13,834 --> 01:23:15,616
I used to like this style

902
01:23:18,701 --> 01:23:20,034
Lee Sum-yuet

903
01:23:22,584 --> 01:23:24,102
Once you walk out there

904
01:23:24,702 --> 01:23:26,235
you'll be marrying someone else

905
01:23:28,917 --> 01:23:30,803
Can you answer a question for me?

906
01:23:31,376 --> 01:23:32,311
Sure

907
01:23:32,437 --> 01:23:33,698
Go ahead

908
01:23:40,909 --> 01:23:42,873
Do you think what we had in high school

909
01:23:43,376 --> 01:23:44,817
was love?

910
01:23:48,766 --> 01:23:51,294
The ceremony starts in five minutes, please get ready

911
01:23:51,334 --> 01:23:52,873
It's time to head out

912
01:24:57,042 --> 01:24:58,334
Lee Sum-yuet

913
01:24:59,389 --> 01:25:01,282
Promise me you'll be happy

914
01:25:08,707 --> 01:25:10,354
Why did you ask me to be your maid of honour?

915
01:25:13,195 --> 01:25:14,866
Why did you say yes?

916
01:25:18,533 --> 01:25:20,900
Because I didn't want to lose you as a friend

917
01:25:23,209 --> 01:25:24,576
Because...

918
01:25:25,542 --> 01:25:27,491
you're actually my only friend

919
01:25:37,784 --> 01:25:42,627
{\an8}Looking back sometimes at yesterday's campus

920
01:25:42,667 --> 01:25:49,294
{\an8}A smile around the corner, tangling my thoughts

921
01:25:49,334 --> 01:25:56,667
{\an8}Dancing hand in hand in class, who could feel tired?

922
01:25:57,060 --> 01:26:01,876
{\an8}The scent of the classroom, midsummer raindrops falling

923
01:26:01,917 --> 01:26:04,294
{\an8}So completely carefree

924
01:26:04,334 --> 01:26:11,586
{\an8}Wishing to cast aside all convention with you

925
01:26:11,626 --> 01:26:16,501
{\an8}In the end, who hesitated and stayed behind?

926
01:26:17,399 --> 01:26:23,211
{\an8}That day, loving you like a confidante

927
01:26:23,251 --> 01:26:27,002
{\an8}Endless curiosity in every little detail

928
01:26:27,042 --> 01:26:29,251
{\an8}Do you still remember?

929
01:26:29,499 --> 01:26:35,569
{\an8}Longing to touch, yet afraid to be together

930
01:26:36,542 --> 01:26:42,586
{\an8}At that moment, however bright the fireworks flared

931
01:26:42,626 --> 01:26:46,161
{\an8}To mask the taste of goodbye

932
01:26:46,202 --> 01:26:51,486
{\an8}Leaving only me, quietly acting out

933
01:26:51,526 --> 01:26:55,959
{\an8}a good show

934
01:27:13,709 --> 01:27:14,959
They're waiting for you

935
01:27:20,876 --> 01:27:22,832
You won't look pretty if you cry

936
01:27:29,532 --> 01:27:34,110
{\an8}Faint yet delicate, that pure white silhouette of the past

937
01:27:31,626 --> 01:27:32,836
Yau Chung-wai

938
01:27:32,876 --> 01:27:37,040
do you take Lee Sum-yuet to be your lawful wedded wife?

940
01:27:34,136 --> 01:27:36,456
{\an8}Taboos of youth

941
01:27:36,496 --> 01:27:43,436
{\an8}Tears playfully falling alongside laughter with you

939
01:27:37,209 --> 01:27:38,453
I do

942
01:27:39,042 --> 01:27:40,336
Lee Sum-yuet

943
01:27:40,376 --> 01:27:44,752
do you take Yau Chung-wai to be your lawful wedded husband?

945
01:27:43,459 --> 01:27:48,939
{\an8}In the end, who refused to look back?

944
01:27:44,793 --> 01:27:49,055
promising to stay by his side in sickness and in health...

946
01:27:49,290 --> 01:27:55,059
{\an8}That day, loving you like a confidante

948
01:27:55,115 --> 01:27:58,326
{\an8}Transforming into tomorrow's distance

947
01:27:55,167 --> 01:27:57,325
This kind of confusion in a girls' school

949
01:27:58,249 --> 01:27:59,862
happens all the time

950
01:27:58,374 --> 01:28:07,403
{\an8}Was it ever real? Hoping to have it, yet all in vain

951
01:28:00,764 --> 01:28:02,542
Maybe it was just an illusion

952
01:28:03,292 --> 01:28:04,794
Once we grow up

953
01:28:04,835 --> 01:28:06,367
we'll just think

954
01:28:07,213 --> 01:28:08,313
it was silly

955
01:28:07,980 --> 01:28:10,101
{\an8}That moment

956
01:28:08,760 --> 01:28:10,040
and childish

957
01:28:10,167 --> 01:28:13,711
{\an8}At that moment, however bright the fireworks flared

958
01:28:13,751 --> 01:28:17,211
{\an8}They were only preparing for what would fade

959
01:28:17,251 --> 01:28:26,297
{\an8}Leaving only me, with no regrets about loving you

960
01:28:24,331 --> 01:28:26,384
(I do)

961
01:28:26,501 --> 01:28:32,209
{\an8}On this day, wishing you well like a friend

962
01:28:32,259 --> 01:28:35,486
{\an8}Entrusting boundless hope

963
01:28:33,376 --> 01:28:35,404
I love you

964
01:28:35,523 --> 01:28:39,422
{\an8}Looking back at you, holding back memories

965
01:28:38,334 --> 01:28:39,807
I do

966
01:28:39,462 --> 01:28:44,378
{\an8}As if in another world

967
01:28:44,542 --> 01:28:50,044
{\an8}At this moment, time cannot turn back

968
01:28:50,084 --> 01:28:53,336
{\an8}Deep love cannot be avoided

969
01:28:53,376 --> 01:28:56,627
{\an8}Only by your side right now

970
01:28:56,667 --> 01:29:02,506
{\an8}My dear, my best friend

971
01:29:23,759 --> 01:29:25,355
What was meant to end

972
01:29:25,428 --> 01:29:27,292
has finally come to an end

973
01:29:28,214 --> 01:29:31,969
Just like every movie has that final moment

974
01:29:32,888 --> 01:29:36,251
In life, there are so many things
we never get the chance to say goodbye to

975
01:29:37,126 --> 01:29:38,916
Just like how we once

976
01:29:38,957 --> 01:29:40,794
spent six years of primary school

977
01:29:40,834 --> 01:29:42,723
looking forward to seven years of secondary school

978
01:29:43,709 --> 01:29:45,959
and then those seven years of secondary school

979
01:29:46,590 --> 01:29:48,485
dreaming of three years of university

980
01:29:49,211 --> 01:29:51,530
In the end, we'll spend our entire lives

981
01:29:51,575 --> 01:29:53,957
reminiscing about the youth that belonged to us

982
01:29:55,520 --> 01:29:57,993
I wonder how many people out there are like us

983
01:29:58,459 --> 01:30:01,490
brave enough to like, but not brave enough to love?

984
01:30:04,698 --> 01:30:05,764
Hey

985
01:30:06,197 --> 01:30:08,717
Here comes our final scene together

986
01:30:10,126 --> 01:30:12,032
Only now do I realise

987
01:30:12,400 --> 01:30:14,880
I was only ever a supporting character in your life

988
01:30:17,136 --> 01:30:18,823
For some reason

989
01:30:19,716 --> 01:30:21,397
even at this very moment

990
01:30:21,764 --> 01:30:23,400
the only thing I remember

991
01:30:23,522 --> 01:30:25,869
are the words you said to me here that day

992
01:30:28,142 --> 01:30:29,968
You were right, you know

993
01:30:31,334 --> 01:30:33,574
No matter what happens in the future

994
01:30:33,841 --> 01:30:35,513
even if one day

995
01:30:35,554 --> 01:30:37,142
I leave Hong Kong

996
01:30:37,751 --> 01:30:39,692
or you have a baby

997
01:30:40,848 --> 01:30:42,220
Or maybe

998
01:30:42,300 --> 01:30:44,360
I'll meet another Lee Sum-yuet

999
01:30:47,370 --> 01:30:48,790
You and I

1000
01:30:50,580 --> 01:30:51,930
forever

1001
01:30:52,821 --> 01:30:54,069
and ever

1002
01:30:54,528 --> 01:30:56,522
will always be best friends

1003
01:31:00,086 --> 01:31:02,216
That will never change

1004
01:31:03,093 --> 01:31:09,572
"The First Girl I Loved"

1005
01:31:15,110 --> 01:31:18,038
I never regretted liking that girl

1006
01:31:18,549 --> 01:31:20,175
It was definitely love, yeah

1007
01:31:20,376 --> 01:31:22,938
The person who keeps walking by your side

1008
01:31:23,035 --> 01:31:25,495
doesn't necessarily have to be a guy

1009
01:31:25,536 --> 01:31:29,467
Instead, you search for someone who truly understands you

1010
01:31:29,508 --> 01:31:32,586
I guess a lot of girls go to all-girls schools

1011
01:31:32,626 --> 01:31:35,533
But in an all-girls school, to really

1012
01:31:36,055 --> 01:31:38,508
develop such a deep relationship

1013
01:31:38,549 --> 01:31:39,605
is honestly

1014
01:31:40,118 --> 01:31:41,650
not easy to come by

1015
01:31:41,691 --> 01:31:44,711
Just because you didn't end up together

1016
01:31:44,751 --> 01:31:46,417
doesn't mean

1017
01:31:46,458 --> 01:31:48,252
those happy memories between you never existed

1018
01:31:48,292 --> 01:31:50,780
I know we might not end up walking the path together

1019
01:31:50,821 --> 01:31:52,193
but I really hope you

1020
01:31:52,234 --> 01:31:53,961
find what you truly want to do

1021
01:31:54,002 --> 01:31:56,680
And keep living well and happily

1022
01:31:56,721 --> 01:31:59,527
Don't give up on pursuing your happiness

1023
01:31:59,959 --> 01:32:03,086
No matter what happens in the future

1024
01:32:03,126 --> 01:32:05,639
In my heart, I'll always consider

1025
01:32:05,680 --> 01:32:09,055
you the person closest to me

1026
01:32:09,101 --> 01:32:12,061
I'll always save a very special place for you

1027
01:32:12,250 --> 01:32:14,350
There'll be regrets, but still

1028
01:32:14,447 --> 01:32:17,510
you'll always want the other person to be happy

